{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5704400a2b9de600728bf390a4fee3c22450c584f6728f4207d04351406526e2", "ja": "（いよいよ、今日は育が劇場のステージに初めて立つ\n日だ。劇団とはまた違う舞台だけど、大丈夫かな？）", "zh": "（今天终于到了育第一次站上剧场舞台的日子。\n这个舞台和剧团不大一样，她没问题吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "748e1cbea5242edfae6cb0633544303bd7a1c1b6e2810fab92072303d26bf3f9", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\nおはようございます……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n早安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f9f1cc074e19c86ee40f1f5c4114324ce14bb33f9cce39df6ad200462a00dd7f", "ja": "おはよう、育。調子はどうだ？\n……もしかして、緊張してるんじゃないか？", "zh": "早啊，育，状况还好吗？\n……该不会，你在紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "b3925bf1d1370ca288ca8ffbc29659990406b71d91a68f467986051d5aeed3c6", "ja": "ううんっ、だいじょうぶだよ！\nわたし、劇団でも舞台に立ったことあるし。", "zh": "没有，没事喔！\n毕竟我参加剧团时也有上过舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "cad09fe7fa0778f69d7d4e7f329c77795d7155d8fe9ed619170d6eb0a4c687e7", "ja": "それに、歌もダンスもいっぱい練習したし、\n失敗したりしないと思うっ。", "zh": "而且唱歌跟跳舞都练习过很多次了，\n我想应该不会失败。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "70063d09da90300aa149e64bef7a0380a7aef23e5841f465c7a529620e83b09b", "ja": "うん……だから、大丈夫。\n……大丈夫だよね……。", "zh": "嗯……所以，没问题……\n没问题的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "12fabbb477997c067350265f1f902b8fee78e37fc036c108ff750a72dbf11ec2", "ja": "（少し緊張してるみたいだな……。舞台は経験してても\nアイドルとしては初公演なんだ。無理もない）", "zh": "（看来她有点紧张……虽然她有舞台经验，\n但毕竟是以偶像身分带来的首次公演，难怪会紧张。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_1007", "source_sha256": "2ce0492e800882bd882c1e169e166ef99080b022ff02eb32e4a3d163d0d38fc7", "ja": "安心させる", "zh": "让她安心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "384dd91f5aadc2ce40d1e28092ac5a4e180b062613c3860fb6397500d1624bae", "ja": "育。実をいうと……\n俺もちょっと緊張してるんだ。", "zh": "育，老实说……\n我也觉得有点紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2001_030iku", "source_sha256": "5f73fedb737875d8c655c7d2cb8fed26debe25b1955e64e7fd706aef218510c6", "ja": "えっ。{$P$}さん……、どうして？\n{$P$}さんも出演するの？", "zh": "咦，{$P$}先生……为什么？\n{$P$}先生也要参加演出吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2002_p", "source_sha256": "1dd2d55887d9f6df77c54e0ed6da560dcd93baff61f039d68fdb47c85185c4ce", "ja": "いや、俺は出ないけど。とはいえ、その……\nお客さんがたくさんいると思うと……ははっ。", "zh": "不，我不会出场。话虽如此，那个……\n一想到有很多观众我就……哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2003_030iku", "source_sha256": "c568fe75362e9708328111473e2157723f85b69f53c5acee372c0fcd6416f7ba", "ja": "へえ……そうなんだ。\n{$P$}さんでも、緊張しちゃうんだ。", "zh": "哦……这样啊。\n原来{$P$}先生也会紧张啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2004_030iku", "source_sha256": "8ae1f6164e9004a29032602c12d7f544cca0aa8f7115e0f401e359581d9da6d0", "ja": "もう、しょうがないなぁ。じゃあとくべつに、わたしが\n{$P$}さんと一緒にいてあげるよ。", "zh": "真拿你没办法，那我就破例\n陪陪{$P$}先生吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2005_p", "source_sha256": "24d5f884c2f19912c988d785c40d928e3df0030df882611be38c260339c784b6", "ja": "いいのか？", "zh": "可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2006_030iku", "source_sha256": "a6709b31bf19f0aa0a996c6145d69625c93598c219ccf60bc333e4e40b34a6dd", "ja": "うん！　{$P$}さん、手を出して？\nわたし、つないでてあげる！", "zh": "嗯！{$P$}先生，把手伸出来。\n我让你牵手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2007_030iku", "source_sha256": "5dd023b18880038018394bc31c5b92764f7b96875c25acfeaa72a879e5458970", "ja": "そうすると、ドキドキしなくなるんだよ。わたしが\n緊張してると、おかあさんがいつもしてくれてたんだ！", "zh": "这样一来心跳就不会一直加速了。\n我紧张时，妈妈都会这样牵着我的手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2008_p", "source_sha256": "0ae950051e1a95be3faa7c597822347456a111e95681329a63e597d75273efb1", "ja": "はは、そうなのか。\nじゃあ、試しに……。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。\n那就来试试看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2009_030iku", "source_sha256": "b8115640ff3aea31353df50179259cb5b0a3c0c3ea7376bd8abeb434b8a4460d", "ja": "わぁ……。{$P$}さんの手、\nおっきいね！　わたしの手が、かくれちゃった！", "zh": "哇啊……{$P$}先生的手好大喔！\n我的手都被藏住了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2010_p", "source_sha256": "29f38f560935947a3f6f4848c1b9e5c138c89b9e0b905344f3887bee9e3563e6", "ja": "育の手は小さいけど、あったかいな。\nうん、おかげで緊張がほぐれてきたよ。", "zh": "育的手虽然小小的，但很温暖呢。\n嗯，多亏你的帮忙，我的紧张也得以舒缓了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2011_030iku", "source_sha256": "211daafcaee1326c0ddb7d238a41df763865e566d86eac3b322b76b67a3c517f", "ja": "ほんと？\nえへへ、よかった♪", "zh": "真的吗？\n嘿嘿，那太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2012_030iku", "source_sha256": "57a88939616837d66c00a4737542119405bdcaa144ea5fcfab54c19a4f8482d9", "ja": "あ……、時計見て、{$P$}さん！\nそろそろ、わたしの出番だよ！　早く行かなくちゃっ。", "zh": "啊……快看时钟，{$P$}先生！\n差不多快轮到我出场了！得赶快过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2013_030iku", "source_sha256": "5c016ac737e69320cb0a48c27ea3002bafb23a641d000fba9928ca9f689e054b", "ja": "ほら、{$P$}さん！\n早く、早く！", "zh": "来吧，{$P$}先生！\n快点，快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2014_p", "source_sha256": "3353eb2d6bbd8267c85155bba279ca0b9b74fb506911aa33b8a7f88ee94ad993", "ja": "ああ、今行くよ。", "zh": "嗯，我现在就过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_003_2015_p", "source_sha256": "8195590ab30cd7b13ade8776881ab4bed5cbeb7bc971334c024f31b20246b64c", "ja": "（いつもの元気を取り戻し、舞台に駆け上がっていく。\nその小さな手で、大きな夢をつかむために）", "zh": "（她恢复平时的活力，跑上了舞台。\n为了用她那双小手，抓住远大的梦想。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
